e_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1447608-vampire-hunting-for-the-thrifty-customer?p=1457074#post1457074\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ooooooo...kay?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sorry, Righteous Endeavour was a Salem witch hunter embraced into the Tzimisce clan. He's a clanbook NPC that stood out to me. The others were vicissitude this, multi limbed that, and in the middle, there's just this Puritan wanker. I loved him so much I had to bring him into Requiem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}